{"action":"script.rules-select","actor":"rules-select","argv":["$PYTHON","$ROOT\\skills\\multi-agent-review\\scripts\\rules-select.py","--root","$ROOT","--files",".zcode-plugin/plugin.json","AGENTS.md","BASELINE.md","README.md","docs/DECISIONS.md","docs/DEVELOPMENT.md","docs/PROGRESS.md","docs/ROADMAP.md","mcp/review_mcp.py","pyproject.toml","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/audit.jsonl","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/checkpoint.json","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/diff.patch","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/ledger-replay.json","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/ledger-summary.json","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/ledger-verify.json","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/ledger.jsonl","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/report.md","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/run_meta.json","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/step1_intent.json","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/step2_collect.json","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/step3_risk.json","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/step4_dispatch.json","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/step5_findings.json","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/step6_verification.json","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/step7_summary.json","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/step8_backverify.json","reports/ledger-demo-round54/20261029-095326-14093d/totals.json","retro/events-round-54.json","retro/next-round.md","retro/pitfalls.json","retro/round-54-candidates.md","retro/round-54-report.md","skills/orchestrator/scripts/runner.py","skills/production-guardrails/scripts/event-ledger.py","tests/test_scripts.py"],"digest":"b4218ae0fde9bfee38257dc2b42d37a38fb40ab8bdb28003da93b80098423d0f","kind":"script","observation":{"exit":0,"json":{"block":"### python-mutable-shared-state.md\n# 规则：可变共享状态的派生数据同步\n\n**适用**：Python 类/对象持有派生状态（缓存数组、句柄列表、索引表）的方法改动。\n\n**判据**：改动某个引发状态迁移的方法（set/update/reset 类）时，必须列出所有\n持有该状态派生副本的对象属性或外部引用，逐一确认同步路径存在且被调用。\n\n**反例形态**：`set_val(v)` 更新了 `self.val`，但 `self.handles`（按旧 val\n派生的位置数组）未重算——读侧拿到 `val=[0.2,0.6]` 而 `handles=[0.1,0.34]`，\n状态自相矛盾。\n\n**评审动作**：对 set/update 类方法的 diff，问一句\"这个方法改的状态，还有谁\n持有旧副本？\"——答不出就要求补证据。\n\n出处：SWE-bench 实例 matplotlib__matplotlib-22711（round-33 容器探针实测\n定位；状态探针见 reports/swebench/probe-state-22711.json）。\n\n\n### python-import-time-compile.md\n# 规则：导入期/编译期生效的语义不只在调用期\n\n**适用**：Python 正则模式串、装饰器参数、类属性默认值、模块级常量、`re.compile`\n调用点、`__init__` 默认值等**导入或编译期才定型**的代码。\n\n**判据**：改动模式串/编译期常量时，语义变化发生在导入（编译）时刻，而非\n调用时刻。评审必须推演\"模块被 import 的那一刻会发生什么\"，不能只追踪\n运行时调用链。\n\n**反例形态**：修复把正则改为\"到导入时才编译\"，diff 里看调用点全部正确，\n但模块一导入就按新语义编译——旧行为残留只出现在 import 顺序敏感的\n场景，单看调用期 diff 完全发现不了。\n\n**评审动作**：凡 diff 触及模块级语句、`re.compile`、装饰器参数、类体\n赋值，问一句\"这在导入期会执行成什么样？\"——需要时要求给出导入期推演。\n\n出处：SWE-bench 实例 astropy__astropy-14365（round-19 复盘：模型侧三处\n修复都没覆盖\"正则到导入时才编译\"这一层）。\n\n\n### debug-statement-residue.md\n# 规则：调试语句不应留在生产代码中\n\n**适用**：JavaScript/TypeScript 中的 `console.log()` 和 Python 中的 `print()`\n（`*.js`、`*.jsx`、`*.ts`、`*.tsx`、`*.py` 命中本规则）。\n\n**判据**：`console.log` 和 `print` 是开发期调试工具，生产代码中残留的调试\n输出会：①暴露内部数据结构（日志中打印用户凭据、内部 ID、配置密钥的案例\n频发）；②污染标准输出/日志通道，干扰结构化日志采集；③在热路径上产生\n不必要的 I/O 开销。改动新增了 `console.log` 或 `print` 时，必须确认是\n有意的日志输出（经过日志框架）还是遗留调试语句。\n\n**反例形态**：`console.log(\"user token:\", token)` 在生产环境将用户认证\n令牌打印到浏览器控制台——前端日志被浏览器扩展或 CSP 报告采集后泄露。\n`print(f\"query: {sql}, params: {params}\")` 在生产环境将含用户数据的 SQL\n参数输出到 stdout——被容器日志采集后进入日志聚合系统。\n\n**评审动作**：对含 `console.log` / `print` 新增的 diff，问一句\"这是调试\n残留还是有意的输出？输出的内容有没有敏感信息？有没有用项目的日志框架\n替代？\"——答不清就要求删除或改用日志框架。\n\n出处：ast-grep 引擎规则 no-console-log / print-debug（engines/astgrep_adapter.py\nBUILTIN_RULES，round-39 引擎落地 + round-40 规则集 v2 扩展；no-console-log\n模式 `console.log($$$)` 可自动删除，print-debug 模式 `print($$$)` 标注\n不自动删除——Python print 可能是有意日志，需人工判断）。\n","block_chars":1907,"matched":["python-mutable-shared-state.md","python-import-time-compile.md","debug-statement-residue.md"],"ok":true},"stderr_tail":""},"prev":"c04916a9076592e41c864e695c4f559205834d9cd582eea1839187d33335c973","replay":"deterministic","run_id":"20261029-125027-9f1593","schema":"action-observation/1","seq":10,"stdin_sha256":null,"ts":"2026-10-29T12:50:40+08:00"}
